Z||000000||Fierodave2001||04-09-2001||01:21 AM||||Hi,  Dave here.  Hello to all the new friends<BR>I made during this years show.<P>I'm the fellow that came with the Blue '87 GT<BR>with only 1700 miles!<P>There were so many great looking Fiero's, it<BR>was just great talking with all the owners<BR>and hearing about their Fiero's.<P>Follow this site to the new album<BR> <A HREF="http://www.zing.com/album/?id=4292795563" TARGET=_blank>http://www.zing.com/album/?id=4292795563</A> <P>Hope you get to see your own car. Talk to you<BR>all soon.  Thank you.||||reg||6
Z||000001||mrfixit58||04-09-2001||09:19 AM||||Hey Dave,<P>Nice pictures. I truly enjoyed your car at the show. It gives us all a great reference point from where our car started. I hope to see you at our next Suncoast Fiero club meeting this Wednesday.<P>By the way, I'm the guy with the other 87 blue GT... 137,000 miles and counting.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Roy  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||14
